  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of Inclusive Refugee Response Programme, Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the appraisal is to assess the quality and feasibility of the proposed 
programme against the strategic priorities in the new Danish development strategy, the World 
we share. The appraisal should be in line with the MFA Aid Management Guidelines (AMG)
Guidelines for Country Strategic Frameworks, Programmes &amp; Projects. Based on this the 
appraisal team will provide recommendations on the necessary adjustments for follow-ups to 
be taken prior to submission of the final programme to MFA senior management for approval.</narrative>
  </description>
